[?2004l[?2004h> got slower and slower, and rows shifted between pages whenever checkout inserted a new order. A keyset page starts
[?2004l[?2004h> right after the last row the client has seen, so it costs the same at any depth and does not move under inserts.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Listings are ordered newest first (created_at DESC, id DESC; docs/API.md). The cursor handed to clients is opaque:
[?2004l[?2004h> base64url of the position of the last row on the page.
[?2004l[?2004h> """
